ct game for those looking for relaxing yet engaging gameplay. Regardless of age, every player will find something here for themselves. Simple rules, charming characters, and the absence of time pressure (with one exception) provide plenty of fun.</p>",
    "short_description": "Some sheep in your flock require veterinary care. Unfortunately, these visits are not their favorite, making them unruly and difficult to handle. This arcade game calls for cleverness, dexterity but without any time pressure. Perfect for anyone who appreciates a dose of good humor.",
